                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Its a very short casual game. You can have fun for 1-2 hours with it you like such games. The bosses need a special tactic and the last level isnt so easy to destroy the tank if you lose before many lifes and hp against the soldiers and canons but its not unfair hard. Last is a survival level where you need to go trough all 4 levels with only 1 life and the last is not so easy because getting items you can trough on the tank and soldier holding you from grapping and you need always to move because the tank makes so many dangerous. Its not so every easy, its a nice little challenge for mid skilled gamers. I enjoy the game even if its no big deal but for a low budget game of a developer with not so many game before (if there even 1 exist) i like it and give a 57 % only because its to short. If you dont like types of this games, dont try it. Thank you for reading.",
